    %% Wiring
    SourceCode --> BuildCmd
    KeystoreConfig --> R8Minify
    BuildCmd --> R8Minify
    R8Minify --> AAB
    R8Minify --> R8Map
    BuildCmd --> DartSymbols
    R8Minify --> NativeSymbols

    AAB --> ValidateScript
    ValidateScript --> ValidationStages
    ValidationStages -->|12/12 PASS| GooglePlay

    InternalTrack --> ClosedTrack
    ClosedTrack --> ProductionTrack

    DevEnvironment -->|firebase deploy --only hosting| FirebaseCloud
    ProductionTrack -.->|Tautan Legal Wajib| PrivacyWeb
    ProductionTrack -.->|Tautan Legal Wajib| DeleteWeb
    ProductionTrack <-->|Konsumsi API Langsung| BackendServices

